{"architectures":["x86"],"id":"EXEMSI.MSIWrapper","latestVersion":"25.0.54.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.272f59ef.png","priority":1,"sha256":"272f59ef959374969ea6b6b7190ef0af0c8362290e4d5f85be4c4503083717ae","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Convert executable installers to MSI packages fast and easy.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.exemsi.com/eula/","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Convert executable installers to MSI packages fast and easy.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.exemsi.com/eula/","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"MSI Wrapper is a tool that can convert non-MSI installers (EXE, scripts, etc.) into standardized MSI packages for streamlined enterprise deployment via systems like SCCM, Intune, or Group Policy.\n\nKey Features/Capabilities:\n- Repackaging: Transforms EXE, ZIP, or script-based setups into Windows Installer (.msi) format.\n- Silent Installation: Enables unattended deployments with parameters (/qn).\n- Basic Customization: Adds product metadata, shortcuts, registry keys, or file associations.\n- Compatibility: Ensures installer compliance with enterprise management tools (SCCM/WSUS).\n\nUse Cases:\n- IT admins needing to deploy legacy or non-MSI software across corporate networks.\n- Standardizing third-party apps lacking native MSI support.","name":"MSI Wrapper","packageUrl":"https://www.exemsi.com/download/","publisher":"exemsi.com","publisherUrl":"https://www.exemsi.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.exemsi.com/version-history/","tags":["deployment","exe","installer","msi","package","setup","wrapper"]}},"longDescription":"MSI Wrapper is a tool that can convert non-MSI installers (EXE, scripts, etc.) into standardized MSI packages for streamlined enterprise deployment via systems like SCCM, Intune, or Group Policy.\n\nKey Features/Capabilities:\n- Repackaging: Transforms EXE, ZIP, or script-based setups into 